setMinLiquidityUsd
├── given the stock is enabled
│   ├── when measured liquidity is below the new minimum
│   │   └── it disables the stock and emits EnabledUpdated
│   ├── when measured liquidity equals or exceeds the new minimum
│   │   └── it keeps the stock enabled
│   └── when liquidity cannot be read
│       └── it stores the new minimum and disables the stock
└── given the stock is disabled
    └── when the updated gate passes
        └── it remains disabled until explicitly enabled
